label "Retrieval evaluation split measurement diagram"
canvas 460 210
box q 8 30 54 40 "query"
box r 86 30 126 40 "retrieve"
box g 240 30 126 40 "generate"
box a 392 30 60 40 "answer"
box m1 86 108 126 50 "retrieval metrics|found? ranked high?" acc
box m2 240 108 126 50 "grounding metrics|supported? used?"
arrow q r
arrow r g
arrow g a
arrow r m1
arrow g m2
note "measure the two halves separately — else every failure looks like a model failure"
